   "description": "Severe thunderstorms are likely to produce damaging winds, large hailstones and heavy rainfall that may lead to flash flooding in the warning area over the next several hours. Locations which may be affected include Giles, Kiwirrkurra and Warburton.  \n          \n          \n          57.2 MM OF RAIN WAS OBSERVED AT WONGOONDY IN THE 1 HOUR TO 2:06 PM.\n          6 CM HAIL STONES WERE OBSERVED NEAR LAVERTON AROUND 1:45 PM.\n          23 mm of rain was observed at Gutha West in the 30 minutes to 1:30 pm.",
